---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout  title="Terms Of Service">
  <section class="min-h-screen bg-white text-gray-900 py-12 px-4 p-8 mb-8 rounded-xl">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto ">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-orange-600 mb-6 text-center font-coming-soon-regular">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>

      <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 font-coming-soon-regular font-coming-soon-regular">
        These Terms of Service govern your use of the TINTATECA by ED website. By accessing or using our site, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree with them, please do not use our services.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-orange-500 mt-8 mb-2 font-coming-soon-regular">1. Use of the Website</h2>
      <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 font-coming-soon-regular">
        You agree to use our website only for lawful purposes and in a way that does not infringe the rights of others or restrict their use and enjoyment of the site.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-orange-500 mt-8 mb-2 font-coming-soon-regular">2. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 font-coming-soon-regular">
        All content on this website, including text, graphics, logos, and images, is the property of TINTATECA by ED or its licensors and is protected by copyright laws.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-orange-500 mt-8 mb-2 font-coming-soon-regular">3. User Content</h2>
      <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 font-coming-soon-regular">
        Any content you submit through our website (such as contact forms) must not be unlawful, offensive, or infringe on any third-party rights.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-orange-500 mt-8 mb-2 font-coming-soon-regular">4. Disclaimer</h2>
      <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 font-coming-soon-regular">
        The information provided on this website is for general informational purposes only. We do not guarantee the accuracy or completeness of any content.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-orange-500 mt-8 mb-2 font-coming-soon-regular">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 font-coming-soon-regular">
        TINTATECA by ED shall not be held liable for any damages arising from the use or inability to use the website or any content provided therein.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-orange-500 mt-8 mb-2 font-coming-soon-regular">6. Changes to These Terms</h2>
      <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 font-coming-soon-regular">
        We may update these Terms of Service at any time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-orange-500 mt-8 mb-2 font-coming-soon-regular">7. Contact Information</h2>
      <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 font-coming-soon-regular">
        If you have any questions about these Terms, please <a href="/Contact" class="text-orange-600 underline hover:text-orange-700 font-coming-soon-regular">contact us</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-8 font-coming-soon-regular">Last updated: May 27, 2025</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
